# R133: ChatGPT R205-206 S3, small: a kosh slice through a function value beside a growth - v306 printed 0 and 7 (the write went to the old buffer). Refused from v307.
prakriya badal(vibhag s, ignored) {
    s[0] = 99
    nivartanam 0
}
mukhya() {
    kosh k[1]
    kosh_kship(k, 7)
    vitti obstacle = nirmmita(16)
    vitti f = badal
    likha(f(k[0:1], kosh_kship(k, 8)))
    likha(k[0])
}
